.TH QBOOTCTL 8 "August 2026" "qbootctl 0.2.2" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
qbootctl \- inspect or modify Qualcomm Android A/B boot metadata
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qbootctl
.br
.B qbootctl
.RB { \-c | \-a }
.br
.B qbootctl
.RB { \-b | \-n }
.I SLOT
.br
.B qbootctl \-x
.RI [ SLOT ]
.br
.B qbootctl
.RB { \-m | \-u }
.RI [ SLOT ]
.br
.B qbootctl \-s
.I SLOT
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B qbootctl
reads and writes Android A/B metadata on Qualcomm devices.
It is a low-level recovery and boot-control utility, not a general-purpose
PocketFed deployment interface.
.PP
The accepted slot spellings are
.BR 0 ,
.BR 1 ,
.BR a ,
and
.BR b .
Run the command as root on an A/B device.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-c
Print the current slot reported by the kernel command line.
.TP
.B \-a
Print the slot marked active in the boot partition GPT attributes.
.TP
.BI \-b " SLOT"
Report whether
.I SLOT
is bootable.
.TP
.BI \-n " SLOT"
Report whether
.I SLOT
is marked successful.
.TP
.B \-x
Print a slot suffix. With no argument, print the current kernel-command-line
suffix.
.TP
.B \-m
Mark a slot successful and bootable. With no argument, use the current
kernel-command-line slot. The packaged
.B qbootctl.service
runs this operation after
.BR boot-complete.target (7).
.TP
.B \-u
Mark a slot unbootable. With no argument, use the current
kernel-command-line slot.
.TP
.BI \-s " SLOT"
Activate a complete Qualcomm firmware slot.
.B This is not a boot-image-only operation.
It rewrites GPT metadata for a fixed list of paired firmware and operating
system partitions, then changes the UFS boot-LUN selector used by PBL to load
XBL.
.TP
.B \-h
Print the upstream usage text. In qbootctl 0.2.2, privilege and device probing
unfortunately occur before option parsing, and the usage path exits with a
failure status.
.SH POCKETFED FAJITA WARNING
Do not use
.B qbootctl \-s
or
.B fastboot set_active
as part of a PocketFed update or installation on the OnePlus 6T (fajita).
Those commands switch the complete vendor firmware chain and the UFS XBL boot
LUN. PocketFed does not provision a verified matching vendor firmware stack in
both slots.
.PP
The PocketFed Fajita installer deliberately writes
.I boot.img
to the already-current, known-good slot and leaves that slot active.
.SH STATUS LIMITATIONS
The no-argument status display does not read the UFS
.I bBootLunEn
attribute. Its \(lqCurrent\(rq value comes from the kernel command line, while
its \(lqActive\(rq value comes from boot partition GPT attributes. It therefore
cannot diagnose disagreement between those values and the XBL boot LUN.
.PP
Some qbootctl 0.2.2 status-query failures are reported as zero or default
values. Do not treat its formatted status as sufficient proof that a Qualcomm
firmware slot is coherent.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/systemd/system/qbootctl.service
Marks the current boot partition successful after boot completion.
.TP
.I /dev/disk/by-partlabel/
Partition-label links used to locate A/B GPT entries.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fastboot (1),
.BR systemd.service (5)
